        "original_id": "662ddf9f-3479-5517-a6b7-fc03cc058336",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The Shoppes at Parma, Parma, Ohio, Cleveland, Ohio\n- Companies: Parmatown Mall, Higbee's, May Company, Dillard's\n- Topics: shopping malls, department stores, mall renovation\n\nFacts:\n- Higbee's was a department store founded in 1860 in Cleveland, Ohio.\n- May Company was an original anchor of The Shoppes at Parma in 1960.\n- Higbee's was an original anchor of The Shoppes at Parma in 1967.\n- The Shoppes at Parma is a shopping mall in Parma, Ohio, about 10 miles south of Cleveland.\n- The Shoppes at Parma was formerly known as Parmatown Mall.\n- Higbee's at The Shoppes at Parma became Dillard's in 1992.\n- Dillard's at The Shoppes at Parma closed in 2000.\n- The Shoppes at Parma was being renovated into an outdoor shopping mall like Crocker Park.",
